@base = http://localhost:8080

### Create
POST {{base}}/articles
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Local library saves stray kittens",
  "body": "A small town library has taken in six kittens found in the returns bin.",
  "author": "Jane Doe",
  "publishedAt": "2026-09-07T10:00:00Z"
}

### Get all
GET {{base}}/articles

### Get by id
GET {{base}}/articles/1

### Update
PUT {{base}}/articles/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Local library saves seven stray kittens",
  "body": "A small town library has taken in seven kittens found in the returns bin.",
  "author": "Jane Doe",
  "publishedAt": "2026-09-07T10:00:00Z"
}

### Delete
DELETE {{base}}/articles/1